Hello World — a bare-metal program linked against a boot stub.
Prints "Hello" via putchar (provided by boot.asm) and returns.
The boot stub halts after main returns.

  main() -> int
      putchar(72)   // H
      putchar(101)  // e
      putchar(108)  // l
      putchar(108)  // l
      putchar(111)  // o
      putchar(10)   // newline
      0
